    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Western Death</i>, you navigate through rooms, slaying creatures, earning experience, and collecting new weapons. With each level-up, you can choose from various cards that grant unique perks and bonuses, enhancing your abilities and playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Introduction:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Western Death</i>, you play as Jack Wotson, a fearless bounty hunter on a mission to track down the notorious serial killer John Willams, a man with the power to wield magic. Your goal is to stop Willams before his dark sorcery brings ruin to the world.</p>",
